WEBVTT

00:16:30.444 --> 00:16:33.405
If cities and regional confederacies,

00:16:33.447 --> 00:16:37.993
held together mostly
by consensus and cooperation

00:16:38.035 --> 00:16:41.371
existed thousands of years ago,

00:16:41.371 --> 00:16:45.417
who's to stop us creating them again today

00:16:45.417 --> 00:16:49.463
with technologies that allow us
to overcome the friction

00:16:49.463 --> 00:16:51.923
of distance and numbers?

00:16:52.549 --> 00:16:58.638
Perhaps it's not too late to begin
learning from all this new evidence

00:16:58.638 --> 00:17:00.265
of the human past,